    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2449" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ănăphŏrĭcus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναφορικός</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In
			astronomy, <i>adjusted according to the rising of the
				stars</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">horologium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr. 9,
					9</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In
			medicine, <i>bringing up blood</i>, <i>spitting blood</i>, Firm. Math. 3, 13.</div>
